{#
    DRAFT policy. The live site has no actual Privacy Policy published --
    its own footer links to usiscs.com/privacy, but that page 404s there and
    isn't in the live sitemap. This draft was written from how this app
    itself handles data (Contact/RFQ forms, Stripe checkout) and is NOT
    copied from an existing source. Flag to the client: this needs their
    (or counsel's) review and sign-off before launch -- it is not legal
    advice and shouldn't be treated as final.
#}
{% extends '@SyliusShop/shared/layout/base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Privacy Policy | {{ parent() }}{% endblock %}

{% block meta_description %}Privacy Policy for US Industrial Supply Chain Solutions, covering what information we collect and how it's used.{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="container py-5">

    <div class="row mb-5">
        <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto text-center">
            <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
            <h1 class="display-6 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-secondary small mb-0">Last updated: {{ "now"|date("F Y") }} &mdash; draft, pending review</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto">

            <div class="content-banner mb-4 text-start">
                <p class="mb-0 small">
                    This page is a draft prepared for review. It has not yet been approved by
                    US Industrial Supply Chain Solutions or reviewed by counsel, and should not
                    be relied on as final until it is.
                </p>
            </div>

            <h2 class="h4">Information We Collect</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary">
                We collect information you provide directly, such as your name, company,
                email address, phone number, and message content when you submit our Contact
                or Request a Quote forms. If you make a purchase, our payment processor,
                Stripe, collects and processes your payment information on our behalf -- we
                do not store your card details ourselves.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary">
                We use the information you provide to respond to quote requests and contact
                inquiries, fulfill orders, process payments, and communicate with you about
                your account or order. We do not sell your personal information to third
                parties.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Payment Processing</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary">
                Payments are processed securely through Stripe. Stripe's handling of your
                payment data is governed by its own privacy policy.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Data Sharing</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary">
                We share information only with service providers who help us operate this
                site and fulfill orders (such as payment processing and email delivery), and
                only to the extent needed for them to perform those services.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Your Choices</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary">
                You may contact us at any time to ask what information we hold about you or
                to request that it be corrected or deleted, subject to records we're required
                to keep for legal, accounting, or order-fulfillment purposes.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Questions?</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary mb-0">
                Contact us at <a href="mailto:operations@usiscs.com">operations@usiscs.com</a>
                or <a href="tel:+19126657257">1-912-665-7257</a>, Monday&ndash;Friday, 6AM&ndash;6PM EST.
            </p>

        </div>
    </div>

</div>
{% endblock %}
